## Bun workspace

Workspace identity: `{{workspace.identity}}`.

The root package coordinates three deterministic workspace entries, in order:

1. frontend application root: `{{frontend.root}}`;
2. backend application root: `{{backend.root}}`;
3. shared library package glob: `{{workspace.sharedPackageRoots}}`.

Each package owns its dependencies, scripts, sources, and framework choices.
The root delegates package work and does not absorb application behavior.
Frontend and backend structure pieces are optional; this workspace contract
does not create or claim their directories.
